[0.000, "o", "- a crash, an OOM,\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m an eviction, a rollout -- a probe is the only one that does it\u001b[37X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m while the process is working perfectly well.\u001b[55X\u001b[24;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n  Two incidents. Both times the service was killed by a check, not by traffic.\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[25X\u001b[32m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[29;103H\u001b[1K\n\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[1m-> step 1.1: Timur ships a service\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[67X\u001b[32;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n  1.1 . Timur ships a service\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[74X\u001b[35m\u001b[1m\r\n=======================================================================================================\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mService is done. Takes 10 seconds to start: warms a cac"]
[0.000, "o", "he, opens a pool, reads\u001b[39m     \r\n        \u001b[37mconfig.\u001b[39m\u001b[88X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mAfter that it flies.\u001b[39m\u001b[63X\r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mGot a probe?\u001b[39m\u001b[71X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mCopied one out of an article. It was right there in the example.\u001b[39m\u001b[19X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhat are the numbers?\u001b[39m\u001b[62X\r\n  \u001b[34m\u001b[1m(o_o) Timur    \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37minitialDelay 2, period 1, timeout 1, three misses. Straight out of the example.\u001b[39m    \u001b[44;103H\u001b[1K\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[?2026l"]
