[0.000, "o", "\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mOne pod with nowhere to go. Buying a machine.\u001b[39m\u001b[38X\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mWhile we wait. This is what those four numbers Timur read out actually do.\u001b[39m         \r\n  \u001b[33m\u001b[1m(-_-) Ruslan   \u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m>\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[37mNobody asked.\u001b[39m\u001b[70X\u001b[29;103H\u001b[1K\r\n  \u001b[32m\u001b[1m(^_^) Madina's notes\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1m. A LIVENESS PROBE, IN FOUR NUMBERS\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m initialDelaySeconds   2   wait this long before the first question\u001b[33X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m periodSeconds         1   then ask again this often\u001b[48X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m timeoutSeconds        1   an answer slower than this is a miss\u001b[37X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m failureThreshold      3   this many misses in a row and the pod dies\u001b[31X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m Patience = initialDelay + failureThreshold x period = 5 seconds.\u001b[35X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m The service needs 10. Nothing else here is a bug.\u001b[50X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[100X\r\n  \u001b[2m|\u001b(B\u001b[m kubelet asks. Not a load balancer, not a human, not your code.\u001b[37X\u001b[40;103H\u001b[1K\r\n/"]
